<title>USA: IPO PRICING- CANTV priced at $23/ADR.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING- CANTV priced at $23/ADR.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Compania Anonima Nacional Telefonos de</p>
<p>			    Venezuela (CANTV)</p>
<p>   Priced At			     $23/ADR</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	   $21.50-24.50</p>
<p>   Number of ADRs			34.2 million</p>
<p>Underwriters Lehman Brothers, SBC Warburg</p>
<p>NOTE: Lehman Brothers syndicate said that the United States tranche of the Venezuelan telephone company's IPO consists of 20.52 million ADRs, while the  European tranche consists of 13.68 million ADRs. Each ADR represents seven class D shares.</p>
<p>---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
